            "\\ours often output multiple answer choices when the model find it is difficult to narrow it down to one (see~\\autoref{tab:example_main} for examples). (2) In arithmetic reasoning (MultiArith), \\ours and \\theirs show substantial differences regarding the error patterns.\n",
